OL,3,AMexican soldiers attacked in wake of
OL,4,Adrug lord's arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FMexican soldiers have detained eight
OL,7,Falleged members of a drug cartel whose
OL,8,Fleader was arrested on Friday, sparking
OL,9,Fa wave of violence in northern Sinaloa
OL,10,Fstate.
OL,12,FThe Mexican defence ministry said the
OL,13,Fsoldiers were shot by the suspects on
OL,14,FSunday while on patrol in the town of
OL,15,FSinaloa de Leyva, trying to
OL,16,Fre-establish order in the wake of the
OL,17,Farrest of Fausto Isidro Meza Flores.
OL,19,FMeza Flores, also known as "Chapo
OL,20,FIsidro", was on the FBI's 10 most
OL,21,Fwanted list and had managed to evade
OL,22,Fcapture for years.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
