OL,3,AMexican soldiers attacked in wake of
OL,4,Adrug lord's arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ministry said the eight had also
OL,7,Fbeen involved in the retaliatory
OL,8,Fviolence unleashed by Meza Flores's
OL,9,Fcartel in the hours after his arrest on
OL,10,FFriday.
